<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
    Integrates Jenkins pipelines with the Harness platform via the Harness CLI (<code>harness</code>).

    <p>This plugin provides pipeline steps:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <b>harness</b> — Runs any Harness CLI command directly from a pipeline step.
            The CLI and its Artifact Registry plugin are automatically downloaded from GitHub releases
            (harness/cli) and installed on the agent.
            Each command authenticates with the API token configured under
            <i>Manage Jenkins → System → Harness CLI Configuration</i>; no credentials are stored on the agent.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        The Harness CLI tool installation is managed under <i>Manage Jenkins → Tools → Harness CLI installations</i>,
        where you can pin a specific CLI version or leave it blank to always use the latest GitHub release.
    </p>
</div>
